      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s first business was a general store run by Ansell Russell and Willis Mills on the historic Fort Worth‑Fort Belknap Road.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
